{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]The Church’s one founda__[A7]__tion
[A7]Is [Em]Jesus [A7]Christ her [D]Lord,
[D]She is His [F#7]new crea[G]tion
[G]By water [D]and the [A]Word:
[A]From [D]Heav’n He came [G]and sought [D]her
[Bm]To [F#]be His [Bm]holy [Em]bride,
[Em]With [D]His own blood He [G]bought [Em]her
[G]And [Em]for her life [A7]He [D]died.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D]She is from every na__[A7]__tion,
[A7]Yet [Em]one o’er [A7]all the [D]earth;
[D]Her charter [F#7]of salva[G]tion,
[G]One Lord, one [D]faith, one [A]birth;
