[Bm]Par[F#]takes one [Bm]holy [Em]food,
[Em]And [D]to one hope she [G]press[Em]es,
[G]With [Em]every grace [A7]en[D]dued.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[D]The Church shall never per__[A7]__ish!
[A7]Her [Em]dear Lord [A7]to de[D]fend,
[D]To guide, sus[F#7]tain, and cher[G]ish,
[G]Is with her [D]to the [A]end:
