[Bm]And [F#]false sons [Bm]in her [Em]pale,
[Em]A[D]gainst both foe and [G]trai[Em]tor
[G]She [Em]ever shall [A7]pre[D]vail.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[D]Though with a scornful won__[A7]__der
[A7]Men [Em]see her [A7]sore op[D]pressed,
[D]By schisms [F#7]rent asun[G]der,
[G]By here[D]sies dis[A]tressed:
