[Em]And [D]soon the night of [G]weep[Em]ing
[G]Shall [Em]be the morn [A7]of [D]song!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 5}
[D]’Mid toil and tribula__[A7]__tion,
[A7]And [Em]tumult [A7]of her [D]war,
